 in my relationships - to keep things interesting. My mother would always tell me to not reveal too much at the start of a relationship. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's ... strange. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Strange? I thought you liked a little mystery in a man.", "time": "21000"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob01re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: There's mystery, and then there's withholding information!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Wow - you are clearly overly sensitive about this, V.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me? I gladly share personal details with people that I'm supposedly in love with! Look here in my study. I have a collection of snow globes, too! What do you think of that?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: It's my way or the highway, honey.", "time": "40700"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob01re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}